&lt;p&gt;Riskified empowers businesses to unleash ecommerce growth by taking risk off the table. Many of the world’s biggest brands and publicly traded companies selling online rely on Riskified for guaranteed protection against chargebacks, to fight fraud and policy abuse at scale, and to improve customer retention. Developed and managed by the largest team of ecommerce risk analysts, data scientists and researchers, Riskified’s AI-powered fraud and risk intelligence platform analyzes the individual behind each interaction to provide real-time decisions and robust identity-based insights. Riskified is proud to work with incredible companies in virtually all industries including Booking.com, Acer, Gucci, Lorna Jane, GoPro, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.riskified.com/customers/&quot;&gt;many more&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive in a collaborative work setting, alongside great people, to build and enhance products that matter. Abundant opportunities to create and contribute provide us with a sense of purpose that extends beyond ourselves, leaving a lasting impact. These sentiments capture why we choose Riskified every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;**This role will be based in Sydney**&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Riskified’s Growth team plays a key role in defining and executing the company’s expansion strategy. We are looking for an enthusiastic, highly intelligent individual to join our team as an Account Executive, spearheading our expansion in Australia and New Zealand. This is a role that combines sales, consulting, strategic thinking, and business analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this position, you will take on leads of potential enterprise clients, develop relationships with multiple Fortune 500 companies, identify their unique needs and challenges, and drive adoption of Riskified’s solution. You will collaborate with other teams at Riskified to ensure a seamless on-boarding process, and use insights from client feedback to improve our service and offering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with clients, demonstrating a consultative approach to directly drive Riskified’s revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive leads from, and work together with our BD Team to manage sales pipeline and follow through with presentations, negotiations, and contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic analysis and critical thinking as we plan long-term expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Riskified at industry events and sales meetings with potential clients around the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of the payments industry and build relationships with key players in the space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and articulate compelling value propositions around the Riskified solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the face of the company across marketing and media initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of B2B enterprise closing experience managing end-to-end sales cycle - preferably with experience with B2B enterprise sales, tech companies, and/or a hyper-growth B2B SaaS startup, focused on the Australian market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a role that requires rigorous business analytics and/or strategic thought (management consulting, finance, business analysis, etc.) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Naturally analytical with a strong passion for persuasion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who loves to quantify the qualitative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Big bonus if you have worked with the eCommerce industry and sold to Heads of Digital/Online&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superb written and verbal communication skills as well as interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem-solver, resourceful, someone who thrives off of autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interact and communicate with individuals at all levels of the organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced sales environment with minimum supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
