&lt;li&gt;Review transactions and make accurate, timely decisions to detect fraud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct fraud tagging, labeling, and analysis to strengthen decision management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze patterns and provide insights to improve machine-learning algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support fraud analysis for customer service tickets and online decision processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
