&lt;li&gt;Flexible work hours (shift work) and ability to work weekends &lt;strong&gt;- required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English verbal and written communication skills - &lt;strong&gt;required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical skills with a focus on identifying patterns and providing insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to quickly review transactions and make informed decisions under pressure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate across teams and support research with actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
