&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Portuguese labor laws and HR best practices- Optional&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in English and Portuguese (verbal &amp;amp; written)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent operational, organizational, and multitasking skills, with the ability to work independently in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and interpersonal skills, with a problem-solving mindset&lt;/li&gt;
