&lt;p&gt;We thrive in a collaborative work setting, alongside great people, to build and enhance products that matter. Abundant opportunities to create and contribute provide us with a sense of purpose that extends beyond ourselves, leaving a lasting impact. These sentiments capture why we choose Riskified every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;*This role is based in Tokyo, Japan&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Riskified is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;results-driven, accomplished, motivated, creative, and innovative Marketing Manager to own all marketing activities in the Japanese market.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;ideal&lt;/strong&gt; candidate is a&lt;strong&gt; Field Marketing &amp;amp; Events&amp;nbsp; B2B manager&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have a proven track record of &lt;strong&gt;planning and executing events of all types and sizes, both offline and online—from executive roundtables to large-scale conferences and merchant summits.&lt;/strong&gt; These events should ultimately build the sales pipeline, create awareness of Riskified’s brand, products, and services, and generate demand for them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for managing all marketing efforts in Japan, executing ambitious strategic plans (as well as tactics) across both sites, helping them build a strong brand name and generate awareness, helping the BD and Sales teams generate and win deals, and helping convert relevant prospects into Riskified customers using all available channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will work closely with our Japan team ( Business Development and Sales teams)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will report to the Director of Regional Marketing for EMEA and APAC and be part of our growing global marketing demand generation team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute the &lt;strong&gt;events strategy for the Japan market&lt;/strong&gt;, designing unique experiences—both online and offline—to build awareness of Riskified’s brand, products, and services and generate demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and qualify relevant conferences and third-party events in coordination with the business development and sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determine and negotiate Riskified’s involvement in conferences, including sponsorships and speaking opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with key stakeholders across the company—sales, product marketing, content, design, ABM, and communications teams—to identify and evaluate new event opportunities that position Riskified as a thought leader and attract the right leads to our pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel&amp;nbsp; to conferences to manage on-site productions and sponsorship setups when needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the events calendar and produce event “quick sheets” to coordinate all aspects of each event, including agendas, timelines, venues, suppliers, giveaways, booths, staffing, and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support for on-site Riskified representatives, handling logistical tasks such as shipments, registrations, booth service orders, team preparation, travel, and booth setup and takedown&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively manage the budget, track and evaluate results against goals, and identify learnings for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct post-event wrap-ups and analysis, including onsite event execution as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with customers and industry players to collaborate on events as co-presenters, panelists, guest speakers, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with additional projects, including customer holiday gifts, campaigns, events, and other initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
