&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of collaborating with B2B sales organizations to build and deliver results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to consistently set and meet tight deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative thinker with the ability to think outside the box&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent relationship management skills with the ability to build, influence, and deepen relationships with stakeholders, especially with sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interface effectively with all levels of management and functional disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge and understanding of marketing tools, processes, and execution of workflows in order to define, track, and report KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of regional nuisances and local go-to-market practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Metrics-driven with demonstrated analytical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
