&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This leader will balance deep analytical and fraud expertise with strong people leadership, business acumen, and the ability to operate comfortably in client‑facing, high‑pressure environments. You will serve as a subject‑matter expert for complex fraud scenarios, performance optimization, and emerging trends, while also implementing the processes, and tooling needed to scale a global operation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Chief Customer Officer, this role is critical to Riskified’s success and visibility with both internal executive leadership and our most strategic merchants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
