&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with research and data science teams as well as product team, to define and implement new features and capabilities; and take an active role in planning the roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with evolving browser and mobile security features and potential exploits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy your code to production continuously (we have advanced CI/CD pipelines)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
