&lt;h2&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Riskified empowers businesses to unleash ecommerce growth by taking risk off the table. Many of the world’s biggest brands and publicly traded companies selling online rely on Riskified for guaranteed protection against chargebacks, to fight fraud and policy abuse at scale, and to improve customer retention. Developed and managed by the largest team of ecommerce risk analysts, data scientists and researchers, Riskified’s AI-powered fraud and risk intelligence platform analyzes the individual behind each interaction to provide real-time decisions and robust identity-based insights. Riskified is proud to work with incredible companies in virtually all industries including Booking.com, Acer, Gucci, Lorna Jane, GoPro, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.riskified.com/customers/&quot;&gt;many more&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive in a collaborative work setting, alongside great people, to build and enhance products that matter. Abundant opportunities to create and contribute provide us with a sense of purpose that extends beyond ourselves, leaving a lasting impact. These sentiments capture why we choose Riskified every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Product Management Team plays a pivotal role in our company, driving product success by working collaboratively with Riskified’s engineering, data science, design, marketing, analytics, operation teams, GTM teams and Sr. management. Product Managers at Riskified are required to solve complex problems, using a varied and multi-disciplinary skillset. We are in hyper-growth mode, so are looking for people who can learn and adjust quickly as the company and our product suite expand. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Being part of our team means you’ll be working alongside smart and motivated colleagues who consistently work hard and execute. Our philosophy centers around end-to-end ownership, which means that every team member is empowered and accountable. We hold ourselves to high standards, have ambitious goals, and are not afraid of trying new things. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As VP Product at Riskified, you will be fully accountable for the success of a broad domain (and domains within), you will be empowered to drive the product adoption across different markets, identify potential partnership opportunities and generate broad consensus around significant product moves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of strong Product Managers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with our Head of Product to define product strategy and tactics to achieve our goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push the product adoption in the market, partnering with GTM to influence strategic deals and identify new partnership opportunities&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively engage with customers and users to discover pains, distill them to product needs, and communicate the roadmap as it develops back to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Marketing and Design counterparts to broadly position the products and build the higher-level story around the products&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable the GTM organization to ship the product to market&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive product direction covering a broad surface, ensuring continuous alignment with multiple C-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define KPIs for product success and identify opportunities to positively move these KPIs. Drive cross-functional teams to execute and fulfill these opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and oversee the product roadmap and roadmapping process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and direct the release of new products and features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
